1
00:00:00,522 --> 00:00:03,442
(Sheldon:)...which are only effective against
wraiths and daywalkers...

2
00:00:03,609 --> 00:00:06,899
...and there are no more left.
The cards remaining in the stack are:

3
00:00:07,071 --> 00:00:10,571
(Sheldon:)Four fire weapons, a troll,
two ogres and the Jewel of Osiris.

4
00:00:10,908 --> 00:00:12,868
(Leonard:)See? Ruined.

5
00:00:13,869 --> 00:00:15,749
(Penny:)Sheldon, that is incredible.

6
00:00:16,121 --> 00:00:18,961
(Sheldon:)From your vantage point,
it certainly must seem so.

7
00:00:19,625 --> 00:00:22,165
(Leonard:)Sheldon has kind of
a photographic memory.

8
00:00:22,336 --> 00:00:24,006
"Photographic" is a misnomer.

9
00:00:24,171 --> 00:00:26,961
(Sheldon:)I have an eidetic memory,
as I've told you many times.

10
00:00:27,132 --> 00:00:31,092
(Sheldon:)Most recently last year during lunch
on the afternoon of May 7th.

11
00:00:32,429 --> 00:00:34,769
(Sheldon:)You had turkey
and complained it was dry.

12
00:00:34,932 --> 00:00:36,602
(Howard:)Well, I guess game's over.

13
00:00:36,767 --> 00:00:38,557
(Penny:)Really? Oh, great.

14
00:00:39,770 --> 00:00:42,020
I mean, aww....

15
00:00:43,065 --> 00:00:44,815
(Penny:)-Okay, I gotta go.
-Why?

16
00:00:44,983 --> 00:00:49,403
Because last time I didn't go,
I ended up playing Mystic Warlords of Ka.

17
00:00:49,571 --> 00:00:52,161
Not "Ka." Ka-ah.

18
00:00:52,825 --> 00:00:58,025
-Bye.
-See you.

